Q: How to call a model method from a class extended from an extension of CodeIgniter&#39;s core controller A: <pre><code>$this-&gt;load-&gt;model('user_model');
</code></pre>

<p>should read</p>

<pre><code>$this-&gt;load-&gt;model('User_model');
</code></pre>

<p>Models names are case-sensitive!</p>
